  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Youth Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to enable rural youth in peripheral areas of Bosnia and Herzegovina to transition into sustainable employment and entrepreneurship, by addressing skills mismatches, access to productive assets (land, infrastructure, finance), and institutional barriers, while strengthening local institutions&#xbf; readiness to absorb future EU funding and retain human capital in rural areas.</narrative>
